    "en": {
      "trackName": "G Maze",
      "description": "WHY YOU’LL LOVE G MAZE\n- Tilt to Control Gameplay: Use your Apple Watch’s motion to move the ball naturally. No buttons. Just skill.\n- Quick, Addictive Sessions: Perfect for commutes, waiting in line, or quick breaks.\n- Increasing Challenge: Each maze pushes your reaction time, control, and focus.\n- Beat the Clock: Race against time and test how fast you can escape.\n- Out of this world Design: Built specifically for Apple Watch for a smooth, distraction-free experience.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\nTilt your wrist to guide the ball through the maze\nAvoid walls and stay in control\nReach the exit before time runs out\n\nGAME FEATURES\n- Real time physics based movement\n- Multiple maze levels with increasing difficulty\n- Timer-based gameplay for added intensity\n- Offline play, no internet needed\n- Lightweight and battery friendly\n\nWhether you have 30 seconds or a few minutes, there’s always time for one more run.\n\nGet lost in the maze, and find your way out!",
